{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Tabula Rasa (They/Them) (The Aers)","id":"863964351622152214","is_bot":1,"username":"Tabula Rasa (They/Them) (The Aers)"},"author_id":"863964351622152214","channel_id":"863933045849849897","content":"Tabula's bird, Capricorn changes color depending on how Tabula feels about their host \nBlack- Tabula attaching to Capricorn \n \nGrey- Tabula having no host \n \nRed- Tabula being attached to a hostile \n \nBlue- Tabula attaching to someone they are neutral towards \n \nGreen- Tabula attaching to a friend \n \nLavender is for attaching to Nolan.","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:05:53.364000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T02:14:27.622000Z","id":"863964352695631962","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863933045849849897","content":"Ohh yes thank you for adding this channel! I has the flavor :3\n\nSo if any of you know my bf Addison from last season, he is a lover of chaos and is helping me come up with ideas for things. \n\nJigsaw loves to add random harmless features to the things they are asked to fix. These things range from small inconvenience to unsettling. Addison has written me a table to roll on... my favorite is #14 \"IT BLINKS\" xD","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:32:04.226000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-12T02:32:50.430000Z","id":"863970941368139796","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"863933045849849897","content":"Added flavor? <:chefkiss:862363896081285151> \n\nSince Phantom Rogues have the *Whispers of the Dead* feature, allowing them to choose a proficiency at a skill/tool, I'd like to think that every time Meorys uses it, her eyes flash a different color (on a very random rotation).\n\nRight now I have it on insight. So if I do an insight check, her eyes will flash -just a random color- blue. It can even flash more than one color at a time, indicating that there's more than one soul helping her at that particular task.\n\nNow just imagine if her eyes go full black <:beholderthink:862363895858200647>","created_at":"2021-07-12T02:49:43.511000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"863975384332894239","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
